| If the problem says...                    | Use                                             |
| ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |
| Traverse graph / count components         | DFS / BFS                                       |
| Shortest path in unweighted graph         | BFS                                             |
| Shortest path with positive weights       | Dijkstra                                        |
| Shortest path with negative weights       | Bellman-Ford                                    |
| Shortest path between every pair          | Floyd-Warshall                                  |
| Connect all nodes with minimum total cost | MST (Prim/Kruskal)                              |
| Detect cycle in undirected graph          | DFS / BFS / DSU                                 |
| Detect cycle in directed graph            | DFS (Recursion Stack) / Kahn                    |
| Ordering with prerequisites               | Topological Sort                                |
| Merge groups dynamically                  | DSU                                             |
| Check bipartite                           | BFS / DFS Coloring                              |
| Bridges / Critical Connections            | Tarjan                                          |
| Strongly Connected Components             | Kosaraju / Tarjan                               |
| Euler Path (use every edge once)          | Hierholzer                                      |
| Max Flow / Matching                       | Ford-Fulkerson / Edmonds-Karp (rare interviews) |
